  "plot_summary": "[ASSET: left | StatementOfOwnership | width=10%] This is not an announcement, per se, but since this is the first month of the year, some of the issues included their annual <b>Statement of Ownership</b> notices.\n\n[ASSET: right | HereComesDaredevil | width=30%] The return of the \"REAL\" Captain America in the pages of the latest <i>Avengers</i> issue was indeed touted in the various house ads that appeared this month.\n[BR]\n[BR] Yet, in the end, it was the announcement of the upcoming [SPAN: fontsize=larger; fonttype=italic; text=Daredevil] magazine that informed readers that Marvel wasn't finished adding new heroes to its stable of characters.\n[BR]\n[BR] [SPAN: fontsize=small; text=(Or is that \"DARE-DEVIL\"?&nbsp; Per the text, it could be <i>either</i>!)]",
  "meanwhile": {
